WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
她：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
Her: (Doesn't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.029
摄影师。你是来拍我订婚的。
A photographer. You came to shoot my engagement.

00:00:25.229 --> 00:00:27.557
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:30.269 --> 00:00:32.581
（Luca画外）Harland把订婚宣布提前了，还有十分钟。
Harland moved the engagement announcement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:32.781 --> 00:00:35.093
Luca，关掉车库监控。三分钟。
Luca. Kill the garage cameras. Three minutes.

00:00:35.293 --> 00:00:37.605
让我……就一次。我得确认你是真的。
Let me… once. I need to know you're real.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
她：什么叫我害的？你把话说清楚。
Her: What do you mean, I caused this? Explain yourself.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:40.305 --> 00:00:42.633
你的气味。我闻到的那一刻，眼睛就变了。
Your scent. The moment I caught it, my eyes changed.

00:00:45.361 --> 00:00:48.510
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。跟我走。
Mate. That's what you are to me. Come with me.

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.860
她：抱歉，我还有工作。
Sorry. I have work to do.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.209
我不是在抓你，我是在保护你。
I'm not taking you. I'm keeping you safe.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
她：Mate是什么意思？你先说清楚再碰我。
Her: What does Mate mean? Explain it clearly before you touch me.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:00.237
只有一个，为我而生。Mate 就是这个意思。
One person. Made for me. That's what Mate means.

00:01:04.975 --> 00:01:06.784
她：好，我跟你走。但路上你得说清楚。
Fine. I'll come. But you explain on the way.

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:08.794
开车。
Drive.

00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:12.813
现在我身上全是你的气味。午夜之前，那家酒店里每一头狼都会知道。
Your scent is on me now. Every wolf in that hotel will know it by midnight.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.413
她：上车，坐到另一侧
Her: Get in the car and sit on the other side.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:15.513 --> 00:01:20.369
很好。就坐在那儿。
Good. Stay right there.

00:01:23.918 --> 00:01:27.068
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:27.268 --> 00:01:30.417
让他们来。
Let them.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
她：谁会来找我？还有，刚才那是谁的电话？
Her: Who's coming for me? And whose call was that just now?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:37.973
Selene。我的未婚妻。其他的更古老。
Selene. My fiancée. The rest are older.

00:01:40.685 --> 00:01:42.997
会好的。我该提前告诉你。
It'll settle. I should have warned you.

00:01:45.709 --> 00:01:48.021
我不是人类。你是我从没想到会遇见的那个人。
I'm not human. You're the one thing I never expected.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
她：不是人类？那你是什么？说清楚。
Her: Not human? Then what are you? Explain it clearly.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:01:50.721 --> 00:01:53.049
一头狼。生来就是。我是我族的Alpha。
A wolf. Born one. Alpha of my kind.

00:01:59.126 --> 00:02:02.276
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:02.476 --> 00:02:05.625
我不会伤你。
I won't hurt you.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
她：握住他的手：我没在怕
Her: Takes his hand: I'm not afraid.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:10.653
她：我没在怕你。
I'm not afraid of you.

00:02:13.381 --> 00:02:15.693
那你为什么在发抖？
Then why are you shaking?

00:02:18.405 --> 00:02:20.717
Alpha，一辆白色轿车刚驶进来。
Alpha, a white sedan just pulled in.
画外:Luca  Alpha. A white car just pulled in.

00:02:20.917 --> 00:02:23.229
站到我身边来。
Stay close to me.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
她：外面是谁？我倒要看看她到底是谁。
Her: Who's outside? I want to see who she really is.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:28.257
去吧，看看她。
Go ahead. See her.

00:02:28.457 --> 00:02:30.785
（画外Luca）她在门口了，Alpha。
Luca: She's at the door, Alpha.

00:02:32.995 --> 00:02:34.804
原来是真的。一个人类。
So it's true. A human.

00:02:35.004 --> 00:02:36.814
她轮不到你过问，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:02:37.014 --> 00:02:38.823
满月之前，长老会会把她带走。
The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.433
她：满月前带走我？你先说清楚，长老会凭什么。
Her: Take me before the full moon? Explain it clearly. What gives the Elders the right?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:48.389
族规。知道我们的人类，不能自由离开。
Their law. No human knows us and walks free.

00:02:48.589 --> 00:02:51.738
我不会让他们带走你。
I won't let them take you.

00:02:55.288 --> 00:02:58.437
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
她：我不想逃，我想留下
Her: I don't want to run. I want to stay.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:03:01.137 --> 00:03:03.465
再说一遍。
Say it again.

00:03:13.729 --> 00:03:16.041
今晚留下来陪我。
Stay with me tonight.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
她：留下可以，先陪我去天台吹吹风。
Her: You can stay, but first come with me to the rooftop for some fresh air.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:21.069
天台？好。先吹风。
Roof. Fine. Wind first.

00:03:25.807 --> 00:03:27.616
好些了吗？
Better?

00:03:29.826 --> 00:03:31.635
Alpha，Harland召集了长老，他们今晚要她。
Alpha. Harland called the elders. They want her tonight.

00:03:31.835 --> 00:03:33.645
那就让他们当面听我的答复。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
她：Harland是谁？长老会要对我们做什么？
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:03:36.345 --> 00:03:41.201
Harland。想要你消失的那位长老。
Harland. The elder who wants you gone.

00:03:41.401 --> 00:03:46.225
他要我交人。我给他一个答复。
He wants a hand-over. I'll give him an answer.

00:03:46.425 --> 00:03:51.249
车在等了。跟我来。
The car is waiting. Come with me.
